1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,724
Xu Yan,

2
00:00:01,322 --> 00:00:02,378
aku…

3
00:00:04,717 --> 00:00:05,597
Tuan Juara Pertama,

4
00:00:06,527 --> 00:00:08,438
kami yang buta!

5
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:10,528
…Tuan Zhou?

6
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:12,782
Perjodohan dulu itu,

7
00:00:12,849 --> 00:00:15,616
kebodohan orang tua ini.

8
00:00:19,828 --> 00:00:21,771
Ginseng, perak, ruyi giok,

9
00:00:21,848 --> 00:00:22,976
paling sedikit tiga ratus tael.

10
00:00:23,679 --> 00:00:24,044
Tuan,

11
00:00:24,377 --> 00:00:25,077
silakan bangun.

12
00:00:25,148 --> 00:00:26,064
Utang lama itu,

13
00:00:26,509 --> 00:00:27,757
bukan urusanku.

14
00:00:27,851 --> 00:00:29,066
Lalu…

15
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:29,971
hadiahnya?

16
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,241
Hadiahnya,

17
00:00:31,433 --> 00:00:32,819
silakan dibawa pulang.

18
00:00:33,007 --> 00:00:34,222
Tiga ratus tael…

19
00:00:34,683 --> 00:00:35,672
Ditolak?

20
00:00:35,757 --> 00:00:36,735
Sakit hati?

21
00:00:37,258 --> 00:00:37,805
Juara pertama,

22
00:00:38,423 --> 00:00:40,327
saya datang terlambat.

23
00:00:40,997 --> 00:00:42,203
Ini dari Tuan Prefek,

24
00:00:42,588 --> 00:00:44,363
dititipkan lewat saya.

25
00:00:45,603 --> 00:00:46,839
Saya beri satu pesan:

26
00:00:47,049 --> 00:00:48,313
pohon tinggi diterpa angin.

27
00:00:48,977 --> 00:00:49,638
Murid ini

28
00:00:49,692 --> 00:00:50,331
akan mengingatnya.

29
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:51,084
Malam ini,

30
00:00:51,153 --> 00:00:52,622
keluarga Tang yang traktir!

31
00:00:52,787 --> 00:00:53,310
Sepupu,

32
00:00:53,369 --> 00:00:54,068
kakak bersulang untukmu!

33
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:55,871
Kakak,

34
00:00:55,937 --> 00:00:56,331
bersulang!

35
00:00:56,843 --> 00:00:57,801
Tuan Juara Pertama,

36
00:00:58,089 --> 00:00:59,038
malam ini gratis!

37
00:01:01,657 --> 00:01:02,150
Ke atas.

38
00:01:02,611 --> 00:01:03,483
Aku mau bicara.

39
00:01:04,142 --> 00:01:04,794
Ke atas?

40
00:01:05,104 --> 00:01:05,663
Secepat ini?

41
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,250
Giok itu,

42
00:01:09,950 --> 00:01:10,638
coba kulihat.

43
00:01:11,521 --> 00:01:12,514
Waktu itu,

44
00:01:12,918 --> 00:01:13,992
wajahmu langsung berubah.

45
00:01:16,366 --> 00:01:17,673
Ini milik ayahku.

46
00:01:18,302 --> 00:01:18,828
Ayahku,

47
00:01:19,244 --> 00:01:20,228
Qin Lieshan.

48
00:01:21,238 --> 00:01:21,913
Aku tahu.

49
00:01:22,089 --> 00:01:23,156
Ceritakan, aku dengar.

50
00:01:23,218 --> 00:01:24,922
Dua puluh tahun ia memakainya,

51
00:01:25,177 --> 00:01:26,211
tak pernah dilepas.

52
00:01:26,851 --> 00:01:27,693
Kenapa bisa di tanganmu,

53
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:29,085
aku juga tak tahu.

54
00:01:29,787 --> 00:01:31,063
Ada begitu saja di peti buku lama,

55
00:01:31,261 --> 00:01:33,796
siapa yang taruh, aku tak ingat.

56
00:01:36,082 --> 00:01:36,617
Nanti kalau bertemu dia,

57
00:01:36,970 --> 00:01:38,412
kukembalikan sendiri.

58
00:01:38,477 --> 00:01:38,700
…Mm.

59
00:01:39,677 --> 00:01:41,050
Misi sampingan selesai:

60
00:01:41,176 --> 00:01:43,591
pemilik liontin giok.

61
00:01:46,832 --> 00:01:47,404
Kalian mau apa?

62
00:01:50,032 --> 00:01:50,587
Tangga…

63
00:01:50,935 --> 00:01:51,742
ada orang.

64
00:01:53,263 --> 00:01:55,173
Qin Shuang, putri pejabat terhukum,

65
00:01:55,256 --> 00:01:56,480
kabur dari daftar militer,

66
00:01:56,665 --> 00:01:57,122
tangkap!

67
00:01:59,564 --> 00:01:59,937
Tunggu!
